1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,109
Finally, the fuel cell.

2
00:00:02,109 --> 00:00:08,776
Unlike a battery, its reactants are fed in continuously from outside, so it never runs down.

3
00:00:08,776 --> 00:00:15,924
Hydrogen flows past the anode, oxygen past the cathode, with potassium hydroxide between them.

4
00:00:15,924 --> 00:00:19,335
This is the cell that powered the Apollo spacecraft.

